@startuml
title G10 - Diagramme de deploiement Docker adapte

skinparam shadowing false

node "Machine developpeur / Docker Host" {
  node "Docker Compose - api-gateway" {
    node "Container api-gateway" as Gateway {
      artifact "Spring Boot JAR\napi-gateway.jar"
      folder "/app/logs" as Logs
    }
  }
}

cloud "G3 User/Auth Service" as G3
cloud "Microservices SGITU\nG1..G9" as Services

Gateway --> Logs : api-gateway.log
Gateway --> G3 : /auth/** + JWT validation contract
Gateway --> Services : REST routes

note bottom of Gateway
Commande:
docker compose up -d --build

Pas de container MySQL G10.
La base utilisateurs appartient a G3.
end note

@enduml
